## Components

- **Buttons:** outline style by default (1px border, ink text). Primary
  CTA only: moss fill, white text, `--radius-md`, soft blue glow shadow.
- **Cards (`.card` class):** frosted glass — translucent white + 16px
  backdrop blur + 1px white hairline border + `--shadow-glass`, padding
  `24px`. Hover: border → moss, `--shadow-glass-hover`, `translateY(-4px)`.
- **Nav:** floating glass bar — translucent page color + 20px backdrop
  blur + ink text + moss underline on active/hover link state.
- **Badges/tags:** clay background at 12% opacity, clay text, used only
  for sale/new/limited labels — never as a primary color anywhere else.

