## Known exceptions

These are intentional, tracked deviations from the token system —
documented so they read as decisions, not oversights, if a future
contributor (or Cline session) stumbles on them.

- **Auth + account pages** (`login`, `register`, `forgot-password`,
  `reset-password`, `account`, `wishlist`, `checkout`, `contact`) previously
  used a separate hex system (`#1C1917`, `#FAFAF9`, `#CA8A04`). As part of
  the v3 redesign those hexes were migrated to the V3 palette values
  (`#1B2737` ink, `#F3F7FC` bone, `#2563EB` accent). They still write raw
  hex rather than the CSS tokens — the next pass should convert them to
  token utilities (`text-ink`, `bg-bone`, etc.) for a single source of truth.

